Borivali East, Mumbai, designed to offer an elevated lifestyle through its blend of sophisticated architecture and modern comforts. Each unit is crafted with top-tier specifications, including Italian marble flooring, designer bathrooms, and modular kitchens, ensuring that every home is a perfect sanctuary of style and functionality.  \n  \nThe project boasts an impressive array of world-class amenities curated to promote wellness and recreation. Residents can enjoy access to a grand clubhouse, a state-of-the-art gymnasium, and a temperature-controlled swimming pool. For outdoor enthusiasts, the premises include a tennis court, a jogging track, and beautifully landscaped gardens. Safety and convenience are prioritized with 24/7 advanced security systems, ample reserved parking, and reliable power backup, creating a secure environment for families to thrive.  \n  \nKanakia Samarpan Exotica offers unparalleled connectivity to Mumbai’s key business hubs and social infrastructure. The project is situated within walking distance of the Magathane Metro Station and provides easy access to the Borivali Railway Station. With prestigious educational institutions like Ryan International School and healthcare facilities like Apex Multispeciality Hospital in close proximity, the development presents a seamless lifestyle of comfort, luxury, and urban convenience.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 888630](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/151736/BHK_Configuration/2-1180-bua-1766126634.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1180 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.6 Cr\n\n![2.5 BHK Flat in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 888631](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/151736/BHK_Configuration/2-5-1405-1766126719.webp)\n\n2.5 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1405 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n3.09 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 888632](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/151736/BHK_Configuration/3-1580-1766126734.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1580 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n3.48 Cr\n\n![4 BHK Flat in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 888633](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/151736/BHK_Configuration/4-1775-1766126748.webp)\n\n4 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1775 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n3.91 Cr\n\n## Key Features of Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Tranquil Ambiance.\n* Spacious Residences.\n* Modern Architecture.\n* Proximity To Essentials.\n* Cool Connectivity.\n* Enviable Location.\n\n## Amenities Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* 24X7 Water Supply\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Lift\n* Security\n* Visitor Parking\n* Power Backup\n* Yoga Room\n* Mud Playing Zone\n* Meditation Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Dth And Broadband Connection\n* Senior Citizens Walking Track\n* Multipurpose Hall\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n\n* Reserved Parking\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Earthquake-resistant\n* Fireplace\n* Rcc Structure\n\n* Kids Play Area\n* Game Corners\n* Indoor Games\n* Multipurpose Play Court\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n* Carrom\n\n* Community Club\n* Recreation/Kids Club\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vaastu-Compliant Designs\n* Gym\n* Nature Walkway\n* Sand Pit\n\n* Themed Landscape Garden\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Organic Waste Convertor\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Laminate finish doors\n* Modular kitchen\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Aluminium sliding windows\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Gypsum-finished Walls\n* American Sanitary Wares\n* Wash Basin\n* False Ceiling\n* Concealed Electrification\n* TV Point\n* Telephone point\n* Acrylic Emulsion Paint\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Multi-stranded cables\n* Concealed Drainage System\n* Smart Switches\n* Geyser Point\n* Granite Countertop\n\n## Google Map Location of Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Borivali East\n\n## Locality Overview of Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Borivali East](/location-review/mumbai/borivali-east-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Borivali East region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Borivali East is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nKanakia Samarpan Exotica is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [Approved](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nProject: Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Borivali East\n\n---\n\n* St Johns High School\n* Everest College\n* St. Lawrence Junior College\n* Sri Sri Ravishankar Vidyamandir School\n\n* Crystal Hospitals Ltd\n* Apex Multispeciality Hospitals\n* Narendra Hospital\n* Arihant Heart And Surgical Hospital\n\n* Growel 101 Mall\n* Reliance Mall\n* Wildcraft\n* Metro Store\n\n* Tavola Fine Dine Bar And Cafe\n* Ruhaans Veg World\n* Surbhi Sweets And Snacks\n* Hotel Sai Prasad Family Restaurant\n\n![Kanakia Group](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/258_1678040166_kanakia.webp)\n\n## [Kanakia Group](/mumbai/sale/builder/kanakia-group-258)\n\nOngoing Projects: 4\n\nCompleted Projects: 39\n\nTotal Projects: 43\n\n---\n\nKanakia Group has created a legacy for 36 years by consistently evolving lifestyles and setting new standards. Sheer elegance with a blend of futuristic technologies and unmatchable amenities has redefined the definition of landmark properties. Principles that differentiate them from others are the assurance of using fair practices, effectively and efficiently delivering commitments, maintaining high ethical standards, and pushing their boundaries to achieve that extra mile.   \n  \nWith a customer-first philosophy, they embrace entertainment, education, and industrial domain along with residential and commercial spaces. 39 residential projects, 13 commercial projects, 4 malls, 4 hotels, and 6 schools are just a few numbers on which they have worked. Having multiple ongoing projects, Kanakia Silicon Valley, Kanakia Greenberg, Kanakia wall street, and Kanakia zillion are their major prestigious and luxurious projects. With smart infrastructures, new-age amenities, and a brand name with the utmost trust, Kanakia space is ideal for making your precious investments.  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Kanakia Group](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/kanakia-group-258), [Properties in Thane by Kanakia Group](https://houssed.com/thane/sale/builder/kanakia-group-258), [Properties in Navi Mumbai by Kanakia Group](https://houssed.com/navi.mumbai/sale/builder/kanakia-group-258)\n\n## FAQ's about Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Borivali East\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n\n### Discover Homes in Borivali East\n\n* [Apartments in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n* [Studio Apartment in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/property/studio-apartment)\n\n### Explore Project