residential building has 17 floors in total and the flat for sale is located on the 9th floor. An added advantage of this 5-10 years old flat is that it is available for immediate possession as the project is already ready to move. The floor of this flat is beautifully designed using vitrified flooring, giving the flat an alluring look. Moreover, this property offers close proximity to important landmarks such as close to metro station, close to hospital, close to railway station and close to market.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![Clubhouse](//content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/16fbca0a-947b-4aac-b003-dfb331461bd0.png)\n\nClubhouse\n\n![Garden](//content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/196e87bf-e511-4d53-a8a4-4c6139ad84b8.png)\n\nGarden\n\n![Gym](//content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/a46c649a-fade-4f15-96e2-ff47432923d0.png)\n\nGym\n\n![Intercom Facility](//content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/03abb944-2e15-467b-a7a9-9d548529e69e.png)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![Piped Gas](//content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/93c525be-52fa-456a-b963-6a09f6d61194.png)\n\nPiped Gas\n\n![Rain Water Harvesting](//content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/2e6e2dd2-8bbe-46b8-87e2-a0f637c9a464.png)\n\nRain Water Harvesting\n\n![Security Personnel](//content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/2a7e3206-f6f9-4417-93c4-577cf702281a.png)\n\nSecurity Personnel\n\n![Swimming Pool](//content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/8b33a8c6-b17f-458d-ae29-09de28e5d1d2.png)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Water Purifier](//content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/f79107fe-9520-448f-b2a4-884213e20148.png)\n\nWater Purifier\n\n![Water Storage ](//content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/c7d7b607-b396-4cda-873d-bd6841e5f468.png)\n\nWater Storage\n\n### Location\n\n* [Nearby Schools](#school)\n* [Nearby Hospitals](#hospital)\n* [Nearby Bus Stops](#bus-stop)\n\n[![img missing](/Content/img/cross.png)](#)\n\n#### Enter Details\n\nHave a question about the property?\n\n#### Get Contact Details\n\n#### Get Contact Details\n\n#### Thank you, Here Are The Contact Deta