Samarpan Exotica Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kanakia-space-samarpan-exotica-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-520;h-260;crop;)\n![Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kanakia-space-samarpan-exotica-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹1.88 Cr - 2.25 Cr**\n\n₹26,413 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## About Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica, Borivali East by Kanakia Spaces\n\n## Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  1180 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.88 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  1405 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.25 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nKanakia Space Samarpan Exotica's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali East.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica | Borivali East |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 41000 | 35650 |\n| Mar 2026 | 41000 | 34750 |\n| Dec 2025 | 35450 | 32450 |\n| Sep 2025 | 35750 | 30650 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nKanakia Space Samarpan Exotica avg. price is ₹ 41 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali East at ₹ 35.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Kalpataru Gardens 2](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-gardens-2/3226/project \"Kalpataru Gardens 2\") | ₹ 46,050 |\n| Current Project **Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica** | ₹ 41,000 |\n| [Kalpataru Gardens Building 1 ABC CHS Ltd](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-gardens-building-1-abc-chs-ltd/27990/project \"Kalpataru Gardens Building 1 ABC CHS Ltd\") | ₹ 38,500 |\n| [Kalpataru Gardens 1](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-gardens-1/3239/project \"Kalpataru Gardens 1\") | ₹ 38,500 |\n| Borivali East | ₹ 35,650 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica start from ₹ 80 K with options available for 3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica | In Borivali East |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 31.8 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 46.2 K |\n| 3 BHK | ₹ 80 K | ₹ 98.6 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.5 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica, amounting to ₹ 2 Cr till September 2026.\n\n#### MMRDA Plans Two New Ring Roads to Ease Mumbai Traffic\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) is planning two additional ring routes, expanding its proposed network from seven to nine. These new corridors will cover approximately 307 km and will connect existing roads and planned projects across Mumbai, Thane, and Navi Mumbai.\n\n#### Thane Infrastructure and Development Updates\n\nThe Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel project saw the launch of TBM Arjuna on August 13, 2026, aiming to reduce travel time between Thane and Borivali to approximately 15 minutes. Amazon Data Services is developing a large data center in Ambernath, with an estimated construction cost of ₹3,500 crore, to be ready by 2029\n\n#### Mumbai Boosts Connectivity with Santacruz - Chembur link road Phase 2 & Chembur Metro Station\n\nCM Devendra Fadnavis inaugurated Phase 2 of the Santacruz-Chembur Link Road (SCLR) & the Chembur Metro Station under Metro Line 2B,The SCLR Phase 2 is expected to strengthen the road network between Mumbai's western and eastern suburbs, improving east-west connectivity.\n\n#### Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel Project: Traffic Diversions Announced in Kasarvadavali\n\nTemporary traffic diversions have been implemented in Kasarvadavali for the ongoing work on the ambitious Thane-Borivali twin tunnel project by the Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA). Certain routes will be closed from July 6 to August 5, 2026, to facilitate construction.\n\n#### Mumbai Monorail Services to Resume After Nine-Month Hiatus\n\nMumbai's monorail services are set to resume soon after a nine-month suspension, following approval from the Maharashtra government for safety improvements and fare revisions. MMRDA has proposed increased ticket prices. The monorail, which previously carried around 18,000 passengers daily, will offer improved services after safety upgrades.\n\nRent in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica ranges from ₹ 71 K to ₹ 87 K with options available for 3 BHK.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 32.1 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 2 Cr | ₹ 32,150 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica Floor Plans\n\n### 2 BHK 1180 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Saleable)\n\nPrice: **₹ 1.88 Cr**\n\n### 2 BHK 1405 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Saleable)\n\nPrice: **₹ 2.25 Cr**\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica, Mumbai.\n\n![2 BHK + Pooja Room,Study Room Apartment For Sale in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shivam Kumar  profile picture]()\n![2.5 BHK + Pooja Room,Study Room,Extra Room Apartment For Sale in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shivam Kumar  profile picture]()\n![2.5 BHK Apartment For Sale in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shivam Kumar  profile picture]()\n![2.5 BHK + Prayer Room,Study Room,Extra Room,Basement Apartment For Sale in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shivam Kumar  profile picture]()\n![2.5 BHK + Prayer Room,Study Room,Extra Room,Store Room Apartment For Sale in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shivam Kumar  profile picture]()\n![2.5 BHK + Pooja Room,Extra Room,Store Room Apartment For Sale in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shivam Kumar  profile picture]()\n![3 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK + Pooja Room,Servant Room,Study Room,Extra Room,Basement,Store Room Apartment For Sale in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shivam Kumar  profile picture]()\n![2.5 BHK + Pooja Room,Servant Room,Extra R