calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Smtjayaben Khot High School\n\n#### Shree Koteshwari Mandir\n\n#### Comprehensive Thalassemia Care Pedriactic Btm Care Centre\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Borivali East\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nUpcoming metro and monorail networks\n\nHuge increase in population\n\n![Key insight rating icon](/assets/images/key-insights-icon/key-insights-ratings-icon.svg)\n\nNo Reviews exist for Borivali East\n\n## RERA Details of Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 32.1 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-03-02 | Floor 13, Unit 1306 | B | 685 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-09-06 | Floor 15, Unit 1501 | 7, B | 923 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-08-14 | Floor 10, Unit 1005 | 7, A | 966 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica compare with similar projects?\n\n![Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica project in Borivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kanakia-space-samarpan-exotica-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kanakia-space-samarpan-exotica/27151/project \"Kanakia Space Samarpan Exotica\")\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Kalpataru Towers project in Kandivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kalpataru-towers-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Kalpataru Towers](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-towers/2944/project \"Kalpataru Towers\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Kabra Rageshree project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kabra-rageshree-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Kabra Rageshree](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kabra-rageshree/3100/project \"Kabra Rageshree\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Kanakia Spaces Track Record\n\n![Kanakia Spaces logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kanakia-spaces-580-5668.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nRunning a legacy of more than 36 years, Kanakia Spaces Pvt. Ltd. is well-known as one of the best real estate developers in Mumbai. They have been known to build a lifestyle for the past 3 decades and are famous for going beyond just providing real estate projects to consumers.\nThe group firmly believes in providing exceptional consumer support based on principled values, even after a sale is made. The group is famous for honouring every commitment and evolving according to industry trends and consumer demands.\nHaving developed more than 14.6 million sq. ft. of real estate space, the group has also ventured into cinema and has designed contemporary multiplexes.\nThe first project of the group was launched in the year 1986 in the suburb of Mumbai, and today they have built edifices that hold strong. This diverse business group has created a benchmark in providing world-class spaces.\nThe residential properties launched by the group are Kanakia Silicon Valley Powai, Kanakia Greenberg Panvel, Kanakaia Zen World Kanjurmarg, and Kanakaia Paris BKC. Some of the company’s commercial properties include Kanakia Wall Street Andheri, Kanakia Zillion BKC, and Kanakia Boomerang Andheri.\n\n![Kanakia Spaces Zen World residential project in Kanjurmarg East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kanakia-spaces-zen-wor