60 sq.ft\")\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 3 BHK Flat 1025 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 3 BHK Flat 1025 sq.ft\")\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK Flat 850 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK Flat 850 sq.ft\")\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 5 BHK Flat 1500 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 5 BHK Flat 1500 sq.ft\")\n\n## Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Floor Plans & Pricing\n\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 3 BHK 1580 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 3 BHK 1580 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK 1180 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK 1180 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"image\")\n\n## Properties in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\n\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK Flat 720 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK Flat 720 sq.ft\")\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK Flat 700 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK Flat 700 sq.ft\")\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK Flat 900 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK Flat 900 sq.ft\")\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 3 BHK Flat 950 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 3 BHK Flat 950 sq.ft\")\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 3 BHK Flat 1060 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 3 BHK Flat 1060 sq.ft\")\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 3 BHK Flat 1025 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 3 BHK Flat 1025 sq.ft\")\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK Flat 850 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK Flat 850 sq.ft\")\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 5 BHK Flat 1500 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 5 BHK Flat 1500 sq.ft\")\n\n## About Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Mumbai\n\n## Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Mumbai Top Amenities\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Price | Rs. 2.93 Cr - 3.93 Cr |\n| Property Types | Flat |\n| Project Type | Residential |\n| Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Status | Ready To Move |\n| Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Launch Date | 01 January 2011 |\n| Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Possession Date | 01 May 2014 |\n| Towers in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica | 2 |\n\n### Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 2 BHK Flat | 1180 Sq. Ft. |\n| Kanakia Samarpan Exotica 3 BHK Flat | 1580 Sq. Ft. |\n\n### Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Brochure\n\n### How is the Borivali East Real Estate Market?\n\n## Ratings & Reviews for Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\n\n![map image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"map image\")\n\n## Landmarks near Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\n\n## PropWorth Insights for Samarpan Exotica\n\n## Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Photos & Videos\n\n![Kanakia Samarpan Exotica photos 1](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Samarpan Exotica photos 1\")\n![Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Parking Area in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Parking Area in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![View from Gate in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"View from Gate in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Parking Area in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Parking Area in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Project View in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project View in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![View from Gate in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"View from Gate in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Pool in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pool in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Project View in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project View in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Project View in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project View in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Project View in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project View in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n![Garden View in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden View in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\")\n\n## About [Borivali East](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-East-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Borivali East Video](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Borivali East Video\")\n\n## About Kanakia Spaces Realty Pvt. Ltd.\n\n![Kanakia Spaces Realty Pvt. Ltd.](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Spaces Realty Pvt. Ltd.\")\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| Over three decades ago, Kanakia Group began its operations on a simple premise - to build edifices that went beyond bricks and cement; edifices that rested on pillars of just and principled values, and held strong long after a sale is made. And that is exactly what Kanakia is known for. Integrity to honour every commitment. Endeavour to constantly evolve.  Today, Kanakia Group is a diverse business group spanning sectors such as Real Estate, Hospitality, Entertainment, and Education.  At Kanakia, innovation is a mindset. We strive to create structures that become a benchmark in spaces. Over the years, we have developed over 14.6 million sq. ft. of residential, commercial, entertainment, education, and industrial spaces. After establishing our core business in real estate, in 1997, the group forayed into cinema exhibition under the brand name Cinemax, redesigning single-screen theatres into modern and technologically advanced multiplexes for a more luxurious viewing experience.  With an interest to promote social progress, in 2002, we ventured into the field of education with RBK Education Institution. To date, the group has six schools across Mumbai and Gujarat, offering the best-in-class infrastructure, and an advanced approach to teaching methodology. |\n\n![Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner\")\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![Chandak Greenairy photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Chandak Greenairy photo\")\n![Fortune Florence photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Fortune Florence photo\")\n![CCI Rivali Park Stargaze photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"CCI Rivali Park Stargaze photo\")\n![Rustomjee Summit photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Rustomjee Summit photo\")\n![Rivali Park Moonrise photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Rivali Park Moonrise photo\")\n![CCI Rivali Park Skyleap photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"CCI Rivali Park Skyleap photo\")\n![Navkarmik Shiv Jaya photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Navkarmik Shiv Jaya photo\")\n![Sanghvi Solitaire photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sanghvi Solitaire photo\")\n![Matrubhumi The Grand Residences photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Matrubhumi The Grand Residences photo\")\n\n## Other Projects by Kanakia Spaces Realty Pvt. Ltd.\n\n![Kanakia Beverly Heights photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Beverly Heights photo\")\n![Kanakia Silicon Valley photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Silicon Valley photo\")\n![Kanakia Zen World photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Zen World photo\")\n![Kanakia Sanskruti photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kanakia Sansk