l Floor Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/139/photo-315.jpeg)\n\n![Wing B ](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/139/photo-314.jpeg)\n\n![Wing B ](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/139/photo-313.jpeg)\n\n![Wing A](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/139/photo-312.jpeg)\n\n![Wing A](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/139/photo-311.jpeg)\n\n![Location Map](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/139/photo-317.jpeg)\n\nby Kanakia Spaces\n\n# Kanakia Samarpan Exotica\n\nNear Magathane Bus Depot, Borivali East, Mumbai\n\nConfig: 2 BHK & 3 BHK\n\nSize 1180 sq.ft To 1580 sq.ft\n\nPrice ₹ 1.80 Cr Onwards\n\nCall Now +919820575619\n\n**Code:** PropertyCrow139\n\nPossession Status Ready To Move Since May 2014\n\nUnits Available Investor / Resale Units Available\n\nAbout Project\n\n## KANAKIA SAMARPAN EXOTICA\n\nKanakia Samarpan Exotica - A Perfect Living Home is a very good residential project located in Off Western Express Highway, Next to Sanjay Gandhi National Park, Borivali East, and an important location in Mumbai. Being developed and constructed by Kanakia Spaces, It comprises of well planned, well designed residential living spaces.  \n  \nKana\n\nkia Samarpan Exotica is an New Residential project with 2 BHK, 2.5 BHK and 3 BHK apartment with all modern amenities and the ultimate result of all ambitions, to be happy at home.  \n  \n**KANAKIA SAMARPAN ROYALE** located in Borivali East is a 19-storeyed condo tower with 3 and 4 BHK apartments. You have a hectic schedule packed with your meetings and appointments. Despite this glitch, you carry out each task with great finesse which is the testimony of your professional acumen.  \n  \nYou need a tranquil and spacious accommodation for you as well as your family. You are a cool a dynamic personality so you need to chalk out schedule for your gymnasium, spa and swimming pool. Your little presence with kids brings a beam of cheerfulness on their face.  \n  \nIt is your love that offers the household all the amenities the loving souls always are fond of. It is you who is the only responsible person who tend to equip the house with a sackful of amenities and you spend without being a spendthrift. You are completely considerate of others never ignore them who are dependents upon you.  \n  \nYou tend to fulfil promises you make unconditionally. Since you are a paterfamilias, your burden never dwindles. Rather you get burdened with additional responsibilities. You have ample time to while away quality time but you can’t afford as your day’s schedule is jam-packed. You need to be relaxed when you return from work. You need to enjoy spa with Jacuzzi, sauna or steam. You need to have a swim in the swimming pool.  \n  \nIf you are gonna purchase property into Borivali, Kanakia Samarpan Royale is a right site for your excellent habitat as it has all world-class amenities which include garden, recreation facilities, power backup, club house, swimming pool, health facilities, gymnasium, play area, wi-fi, rain water harvesting, security.  \n  \nCall us for more details about this project. We would be glad to help you further with complete details and provide best deal in the market.\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 1180 | 1.80 CR |\n| 2.5 BHK | 1405 | 2.14 CR |\n| 3 BHK | 1580 | 2.41 CR |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n\\* Swimming Pool  \n\\* Clubhouse  \n\\* Gymnasium  \n\\* Steam  \n\\* Sauna  \n\\* Jacuzzi  \n\\* Games Room  \n\\* Landscaped external areas  \n\\* Children Play Area  \n\\* Senior Citizen Sitting area  \n\\* Ample Parking Space  \n\\* Round the clock security guard and security systems\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n\\* Premium Italian Marble Flooring  \n\\* Split Air-conditioner in Living Room & Bedrooms  \n\\* Designer Bathrooms and Luxury Sanitary Ware  \n\\* Modular Granite Platform and Stainless Steel Sink  \n\\* Teak wood Door Frames with Laminates for Main Door  \n\\* Rich Plaster-of-Paris Finished Internal Walls and Ceiling  \n\\* High Quality Concealed Copper Wiring  \n\\* Premium Brand Electrical Fittings  \n\\* Video Door Phone  \n\\* Anodized Aluminum Windows  \n\\* POP finish on internal walls and ceiling  \n\\* Stainless Steel balcony Railing with Glass  \n\\* Rich Granite Kitchen Platform with Stainless Steel Sink\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - Near Magathane Bus Depot, Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** Near Magathane Bus Depot, Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** Western Express Highway, National park Kanheri Caves road, Main Carter road, Mahatma Gandhi road, Kasturba Cross road, Mahadev Bhai desai road & Dattapad Road\n\nFAQ\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about KANAKIA SAMARPAN EXOTICA\n\nWhere is Kanakia Samarpan Exotica Exactly located?\n\nKanakia Samarpan Exotica is located at Near Magathane Bus Depot, Borivali East, .\n\nWhat are unit options available in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica?\n\nKanakia Samarpan Exotica offers 2 BHK & 3 BHK.\n\nWhat is the starting price of Flats in Kanakia Samarpan Exotica?\n\nThe starting price of Flats at Kanakia Samarpan Exotica is 1.80 Cr Onwards. Contact us for the latest pricing and offers.\n\nWhen is the Possession of Flats?\n\nThe expected possession date for Kanakia Samarpan Exotica is Ready To Move Since May 2014.\n\nWhat are the nearest landmarks?\n\nKey landmarks near Kanakia Samarpan Exotica include Saffron Exhibition, Parmar Hospital, Sanjay Gandhi National Park, Fair Price Mall, ICICI Bank, Bank of India, Flavours Hotel, Axis Bank & GH High school.\n\nIs Kanakia Samarpan Exotica, approved by Banks for Home Loans?\n\nYes, Kanakia Samarpan Exotica is approved by leading banks and fi